</strong>Carlos Torres</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">While working at <a href=\"http://cixi.life\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"cixi.life\">CIXI</a>, a French startup revolutionizing pedaling technology, I contributed to digital products and design studies for over two years. This video marked a pivotal moment as we prepared to introduce our innovation to the world. The project was meticulously crafted, with every word and visual element carefully designed to convey our message effectively.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\"}}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10)\">Process</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\"}}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\">We started out by defined all the visuals related to the voice over. The main important points we consider where <em>vision</em> and <em>active mobility. </em> Hence different, even crazy vehicles and people pedalling. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"30px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block