g--60);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\">Following <a href=\"https://www.domestika.org/en/courses/235-2d-animation-with-photoshop-draw-camera-action\">Numencaniq’s 2D camera course</a>, which focuses on framing, camera movements, and spacing, I planned the animation beforehand. This preparation allowed me to quickly map out the sequence without overthinking each position, effectively exaggerating the movement through camera angles, spacing, and timing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:modula/gallery {\"id\":125,\"images\":[{\"id\":\"117\",\"alt\":\"Sketches\",\"title\":\"Sketches\",\"description\":\"Initial sketches\",\"halign\":\"center\",\"valign\":\"middle\",\"link\":\"\",\"target\":0,\"width\":1024,\"height\":1024,\"togglelightbox\":0,\"src\":\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Sketches-1024x1024.png\",\"data-width\":2,\"data-height\":2},{\"id\":\"104\",\"alt\":\"Rotating character head\",\"title\":\"character head\",\"description\":\"character turnaround\",\"halign\":\"center\",\"valign\":\"middle\",\"link\":\"\",\"target\":0,\"width\":600,\"height\":600,\"togglelightbox\":0,\"src\":\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/head.gif\",\"data-width\":2,\"data-height\":2},{\"id\":\"146\",\"alt\":\"Character\",\"title\":\"characterdesign\",\"description\":\"Character\",\"halign\":\"center\",\"valign\":\"middle\",\"link\":\"\",\"target\":0,\"width\":1024,\"height\":1024,\"togglelightbox\":0,\"src\":\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/characterdesign-1024x1024.png\",\"data-width\":4,\"data-height\":4},{\"id\":\"118\",\"alt\":\"Planning\",\"title\":\"Planning\",\"description\":\"Planning\",\"halign\":\"center\",\"valign\":\"middle\",\"link\":\"\",\"target\":0,\"width\":1024,\"height\":1024,\"togglelightbox\":0,\"src\":\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Planning-1024x1024.png\",\"data-width\":4,\"data-height\":3},{\"id\":\"86\",\"alt\":\"Character poses\",\"title\":\