 {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Onboard screens and design research</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Goal:</strong> Define and test user interactions on the Vigoz, a vehicle controlled by pedaling and tilting that arrives up to 120 km/h.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The possible users, as we discovered, were people interested on getting healthy, but not necessarily fit or energetic. So, How to define an interactive system to support changing the \"Effort level\" and making physical activity while keeping a certain premium feeling and of course, focusing on the ride ?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":643,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Screens-ui-2-1024x576.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-643\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','CIXI','','inherit','closed','closed','','618-revision-v1','','','2024-07-29 21:52:27','2024-07-29 19:52:27','',618,'http://localhost:10003/?p=688',0,'revision','',0);
