INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (856,1,'2024-07-30 13:58:45','2024-07-30 11:58:45','<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Heading\"},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}},\"className\":\"heading\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"600px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group heading\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":1,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}}} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">Diorama digital experiences</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\"}},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|contrast\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"contrast\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-contrast-color has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-right:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-left:0\">An exhibition hall, a 3D environment to settle the grounds for an exploration. Setting an impact effect, scrolling and exploring in a surreal environment.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Content\"},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}},\"className\":\"content\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"wideSize\":\"60%\",\"contentSize\":\"600px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group content\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:0\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true},\"id\":792,\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/initial-ezgif.com-optimize.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-792\" style=\"object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10)\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"0px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\"}}},\"className\":\"is-style-outline\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button has-custom-font-size is-style-outline has-medium-font-size\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://diorama.eu\" style=\"border-radius:0px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">Explore website</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\"><strong>The labyrinth</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n<p style=\"padding-right:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:0\">A concept to showcase Diorama’s work, for the moment capable of instructions on where and what size to position work, this will allow anyone without experience of code to curate the interior.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true},\"id\":774,\"width\":\"500px\",\"height\":\"500px\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/lab.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-774\" style=\"object-fit:cover;width:500px;height:500px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\"><strong>Aesthetic exploration</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"50%\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\",\"padding\":{\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Creating websites its not an easy and direct task. There is always a balance between the visual experience and usability. Meaning we have to avocate for the smoothness and the sense of the experience as well.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is why exploration of our limitations (like size of 3d models and lighting) guides our creativity to different areas.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This way, we can share this experiences to anyone, anytime, anywhere in the world.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"50%\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":775,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/image-868x1024.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-775\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"50%\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\",\"padding\":{\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":797,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/model-ezgif.com-optimize.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-797\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Importing 3d models</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"50%\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true},\"id\":796,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/materials-ezgif.com-optimize.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-796\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"> Materials and lighting</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true},\"id\":795,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/camera-ezgif.com-optimize-1.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-795\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Camera movements and navigation</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:block {\"ref\":840} /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','Diorama','','inherit','closed','closed','','770-revision-v1','','','2024-07-30 13:58:45','2024-07-30 11:58:45','',770,'http://localhost:10003/?p=856',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (857,1,'2024-07-30 13:59:32','2024-07-30 11:59:32','<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Heading\"},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}},\"className\":\"heading\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"600px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group heading\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":1,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}}} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">CIXI</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\"}},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|contrast\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"contrast\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-contrast-color has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-right:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-left:0\">A startup in the French alps developing mobility solutions that work for an adoption of physical activity and overall wellness through electric pedaling vehicles and their technology.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Content\"},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}},\"className\":\"content\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"wideSize\":\"60%\",\"contentSize\":\"600px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group content\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:0\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true},\"id\":643,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Screens-ui-2-1024x576.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-643\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\"><strong>Onboard screens and design research</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<p style=\"padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0\"><strong>Goal:</strong>&nbsp;Define and test user interactions on the Vigoz, a vehicle controlled by pedaling and tilting that arrives up to 120 km/h.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<p style=\"padding-right:0;padding-left:0\">The possible users, as we discovered, were people interested on getting healthy, but not necessarily fit or energetic. So, How to define an interactive system to support changing the \"Effort level\" and making physical activity while keeping a certain premium feeling and of course, focusing on the ride ?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"50%\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\",\"padding\":{\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To understand if this interactions could work, we tested “lego type” prototypes to switch between different interaction interfaces and screens on a first internal research with people within the company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We decided to have a second research, inviting possible customers over and designing a full interaction experience with the pedaling environment over virtual reality to understand what way to go, which type of screens, handles and functionalities to support.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For the planning of the research, with a team of three designers with different skillsets, we were able to take the best of us during this sprint. Carlos (head of design at CIXI , experience on IDEO, Lego) lead the research and interviews and designed an onboarding process, Daniel Sanchez (industrial designer) helped with the design of handles and several 3d printed elements and I took the role for the digital prototypes and “magic wizard”.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"50%\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true},\"id\":644,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/prototypes.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-644\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true},\"id\":645,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/unnamed-1-1.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-645\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":646,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/screens-top-1024x576.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-646\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}}} -->\n<p style=\"padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20)\">The test consisted on going through a theoretical acquisition of a membership with the Vigoz through a web prototype, understanding client expectations, using a web app and pedaling on the cardboard prototype. We had really interesting results, realizing there was still a long path to support our philosophy and promote a new vehicle which is neither a bicycle nor a car.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div style=\"text-align:center;display:flex;justify-content:center\"><iframe center=\"\" src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/723977908?h=e9b5b1c9c5&amp;autoplay=1&amp;loop=1&amp;autopause=0\" width=\"1280\" height=\"500\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}}} -->\n<p style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">Regarding the top touchscreen, unfortunately we had to let go the idea, it required too much cognitive effort.&nbsp;We went instead to a new solution…</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"columns\":2,\"linkTo\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-2 is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":698,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/IMG_0156-scaled-1-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-698\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">checking account</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":700,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/DSC00320-scaled-1-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-700\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">tracking tests</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":699,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/IMG_0421-scaled-1-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-699\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">app</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":701,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/IMG_0268-scaled-1-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-701\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">multiple interactions</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":702,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/IMG_0444-scaled-1-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-702\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">pedalling</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":697,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/IMG_0255-scaled-1-1024x575.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-697\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">immersive prototyping</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"50%\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\",\"padding\":{\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After a new exploration , we realized a \"panoramic screen\" in a combination with a more \"standard screen\" could be a great spot to enhance the possibilities and physical design of the interior. We decided to leave some functions on the mobile app ,so we could focus the best of the driving sensations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"50%\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:gallery {\"columns\":2,\"linkTo\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-2 is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":707,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/screen.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-707\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":705,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/screen_2.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-705\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":706,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/unnamed-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-706\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\"}}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\"><strong>Website and content creation</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We went through a process of finding the best communication strategy to show our motivation as CIXI and a little bit of our products without showing too much.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After some sketching and several graphic iterations, we focused on captivating interest through a combination of interactive animations by scrolling and \"easy-going\" animations by code (Lottie). </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">Note: 3D render by Carlos Torres</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"linkTo\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":722,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/logo_animation_repeated.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-722\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":723,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/meditation_timing-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-723\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":724,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/essential-comfort_color_padding-1024x683.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-724\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":709,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/bike.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-709\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":710,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/exam.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-710\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":711,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/animation_500_l56xwnzu.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-711\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":712,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/fast_hyfit_1080_square-1024x1024.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-712\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":713,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/hand.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-713\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":708,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/animation_500_l56x6299.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-708\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":714,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/gif_1-1.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-714\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A mobile approach allowed us to expose our philosophy for people or companies that were curious, where we deep-fully engaged with the subjects that move us.It was also important for us to grow our subscribers, with a simple design and enough about us, we encouraged people to follow our path.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n<p style=\"padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\">enjoyed being involved on the whole process of ideation, experimenting and co-creating how to communicate our vision. Flexibility, vision, getting into details and then at the big level where crucial points to arrive at this compromise of engaging, but simple introduction to what we are building.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":719,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Screens_website-1-1024x750.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-719\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Mobile version</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":718,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Screens_website_big-1024x640.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-718\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Desktop version</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\"}}}} -->\n<p style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">A small experiment of tackling an important subject : what we design and develop and its impact on the planet. It served a starting point to understand our communication tone, for sure there is much to do to have less impact on this planet.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://vimeo.com/991951744\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"vimeo\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-vimeo wp-block-embed-vimeo wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://vimeo.com/991951744\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:block {\"ref\":840} /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','CIXI design','','inherit','closed','closed','','618-revision-v1','','','2024-07-30 13:59:32','2024-07-30 11:59:32','',618,'http://localhost:10003/?p=857',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (858,1,'2024-07-30 13:59:57','2024-07-30 11:59:57','<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Heading\"},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}},\"className\":\"heading\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"600px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group heading\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":1,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}}} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">Hand rehabilitation for chronic pain<br></h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\"}},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|contrast\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"contrast\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-contrast-color has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0\">VR interactive system that allows specialists to remotely follow chronic hand pain patients.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Content\"},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}},\"className\":\"content\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"wideSize\":\"60%\",\"contentSize\":\"600px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group content\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:0\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div style=\"padding:50.25% 0 0 0;position:relative;\"><iframe src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/721492032?h=2ed6b811f0&amp;badge=0&amp;autopause=0&amp&autoplay=1&muted=1&loop=1;player_id=0&amp;app_id=58479\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;\" title=\"Hand rehabilitation Project\"></iframe></div><script src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/api/player.js\"></script>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"top\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20)\"><strong>Research background</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<p style=\"padding-right:0;padding-left:0\">The project is based on an existing rehabilitation treatment for chronic pain and complex regional pain, in this method patients place the unaffected hand in front of a mirror where the reflection makes the illusion of normal hand movements on the affected hand.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20)\"><strong>Design challenge</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<p style=\"padding-right:0;padding-left:0\">How can we develop an environment for rehabilitation specialists to&nbsp;support and motivate&nbsp;patients with CPRS to reduce their&nbsp;pain sensation&nbsp;with the help of Mirror Visual Feedback?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"bottom\":\"0\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:0\"><strong>Implementation</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"50%\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\",\"padding\":{\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The final solution involves digital recognition of affected limbs program which translates the limited movements to virtual “healthy” movements.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In order to support the appropiation of the movements, the patient’s hand model and amount of virtual aid to translate movements can be directly modified on the program.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"50%\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true},\"id\":736,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/aided_therapy_overview.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-736\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true},\"id\":737,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/user_journey-1024x488.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-737\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Download the project report&nbsp;<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1lZVF-pNJp9UdKqm_bFqzITGzQWtZg1NP/view\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">[here]</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">References:[1] V. S. Ramachandran, Eric L. Altschuler, The use of visual feedback, in particular mirror visual feedback, in restoring brain function, Brain, Volume 132, Issue 7, July 2009, Pages 1693–1710, https://doi.org/10.1093/brain/awp135[2] G.L. Moseley (2004) . Pain. Graded motor imagery is effective for long-standing complex regional pain syndrome: a randomised controlled trial.[4] W. Priganc Victoria, W. Stralka Susan (2011). JHT READ FOR CREDIT ARTICLE #190. Graded Motor Imagery.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:block {\"ref\":840} /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','Hand rehabilitation for chronic pain','','inherit','closed','closed','','735-revision-v1','','','2024-07-30 13:59:57','2024-07-30 11:59:57','',735,'http://localhost:10003/?p=858',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (859,1,'2024-07-30 14:00:15','2024-07-30 12:00:15','<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Heading\"},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}},\"className\":\"heading\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"600px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group heading\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":1,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}}} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">Lexus shaped by air</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\"}},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|contrast\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"contrast\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-contrast-color has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-right:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:0\">As part of the Milan Design week, Diorama partenered with Lexus to create an immersion in a deep forest, with threads of wind, rusty leaves and rays of light. From the individual forms of the Lexus Elecrified Sport coupe, this hypnotic interactive world sees the Lexus design language through the prism of nature’s cues. Inspired by the Japanese concept of ‘shine-to’ (like nature), the pieces come together to show what can happen when engineering and nature combine.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Content\"},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}},\"className\":\"content\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"wideSize\":\"60%\",\"contentSize\":\"60px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group content\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:0\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10)\"><!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"0px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\"}}},\"className\":\"is-style-outline\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button has-custom-font-size is-style-outline has-medium-font-size\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://discoverlexus.com/stories/shaped-by-air-at-milan-design-week-2023-metaverse-experience/\" style=\"border-radius:0px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Explore website</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"columns\":2,\"linkTo\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-2 is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":809,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/1-ezgif.com-crop.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-809\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":807,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/3-ezgif.com-crop.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-807\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":810,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/2-ezgif.com-crop-1.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-810\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:block {\"ref\":840} /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','Lexus shaped by air','','inherit','closed','closed','','790-revision-v1','','','2024-07-30 14:00:15','2024-07-30 12:00:15','',790,'http://localhost:10003/?p=859',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (860,1,'2024-07-30 14:00:31','2024-07-30 12:00:31','<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Heading\"},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}},\"className\":\"heading\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"600px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group heading\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":1,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}}} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">Lexus shaped by air</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\"}},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|contrast\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"contrast\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-contrast-color has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-right:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:0\">As part of the Milan Design week, Diorama partenered with Lexus to create an immersion in a deep forest, with threads of wind, rusty leaves and rays of light. From the individual forms of the Lexus Elecrified Sport coupe, this hypnotic interactive world sees the Lexus design language through the prism of nature’s cues. Inspired by the Japanese concept of ‘shine-to’ (like nature), the pieces come together to show what can happen when engineering and nature combine.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Content\"},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}},\"className\":\"content\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"wideSize\":\"600px\",\"contentSize\":\"600px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group content\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:0\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10)\"><!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"0px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\"}}},\"className\":\"is-style-outline\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button has-custom-font-size is-style-outline has-medium-font-size\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://discoverlexus.com/stories/shaped-by-air-at-milan-design-week-2023-metaverse-experience/\" style=\"border-radius:0px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Explore website</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"columns\":2,\"linkTo\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-2 is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":809,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/1-ezgif.com-crop.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-809\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":807,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/3-ezgif.com-crop.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-807\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":810,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/2-ezgif.com-crop-1.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-810\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:block {\"ref\":840} /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','Lexus shaped by air','','inherit','closed','closed','','790-revision-v1','','','2024-07-30 14:00:31','2024-07-30 12:00:31','',790,'http://localhost:10003/?p=860',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (861,1,'2024-07-30 14:00:46','2024-07-30 12:00:46','<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Heading\"},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}},\"className\":\"heading\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"600px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group heading\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":1,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}}} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">Hand rehabilitation for chronic pain<br></h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\"}},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|contrast\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"contrast\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-contrast-color has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0\">VR interactive system that allows specialists to remotely follow chronic hand pain patients.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Content\"},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}},\"className\":\"content\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"wideSize\":\"600px\",\"contentSize\":\"600px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group content\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:0\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div style=\"padding:50.25% 0 0 0;position:relative;\"><iframe src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/721492032?h=2ed6b811f0&amp;badge=0&amp;autopause=0&amp&autoplay=1&muted=1&loop=1;player_id=0&amp;app_id=58479\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;\" title=\"Hand rehabilitation Project\"></iframe></div><script src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/api/player.js\"></script>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"top\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20)\"><strong>Research background</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<p style=\"padding-right:0;padding-left:0\">The project is based on an existing rehabilitation treatment for chronic pain and complex regional pain, in this method patients place the unaffected hand in front of a mirror where the reflection makes the illusion of normal hand movements on the affected hand.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20)\"><strong>Design challenge</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<p style=\"padding-right:0;padding-left:0\">How can we develop an environment for rehabilitation specialists to&nbsp;support and motivate&nbsp;patients with CPRS to reduce their&nbsp;pain sensation&nbsp;with the help of Mirror Visual Feedback?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"bottom\":\"0\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:0\"><strong>Implementation</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"50%\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\",\"padding\":{\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The final solution involves digital recognition of affected limbs program which translates the limited movements to virtual “healthy” movements.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In order to support the appropiation of the movements, the patient’s hand model and amount of virtual aid to translate movements can be directly modified on the program.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"50%\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true},\"id\":736,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/aided_therapy_overview.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-736\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true},\"id\":737,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/user_journey-1024x488.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-737\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Download the project report&nbsp;<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1lZVF-pNJp9UdKqm_bFqzITGzQWtZg1NP/view\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">[here]</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">References:[1] V. S. Ramachandran, Eric L. Altschuler, The use of visual feedback, in particular mirror visual feedback, in restoring brain function, Brain, Volume 132, Issue 7, July 2009, Pages 1693–1710, https://doi.org/10.1093/brain/awp135[2] G.L. Moseley (2004) . Pain. Graded motor imagery is effective for long-standing complex regional pain syndrome: a randomised controlled trial.[4] W. Priganc Victoria, W. Stralka Susan (2011). JHT READ FOR CREDIT ARTICLE #190. Graded Motor Imagery.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:block {\"ref\":840} /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','Hand rehabilitation for chronic pain','','inherit','closed','closed','','735-revision-v1','','','2024-07-30 14:00:46','2024-07-30 12:00:46','',735,'http://localhost:10003/?p=861',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (862,1,'2024-07-30 14:00:57','2024-07-30 12:00:57','<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Heading\"},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}},\"className\":\"heading\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"600px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group heading\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":1,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}}} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">Diorama digital experiences</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\"}},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|contrast\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"contrast\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-contrast-color has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-right:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-left:0\">An exhibition hall, a 3D environment to settle the grounds for an exploration. Setting an impact effect, scrolling and exploring in a surreal environment.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Content\"},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}},\"className\":\"content\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"wideSize\":\"600px\",\"contentSize\":\"600px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group content\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:0\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true},\"id\":792,\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/initial-ezgif.com-optimize.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-792\" style=\"object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10)\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"0px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\"}}},\"className\":\"is-style-outline\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button has-custom-font-size is-style-outline has-medium-font-size\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://diorama.eu\" style=\"border-radius:0px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">Explore website</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\"><strong>The labyrinth</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n<p style=\"padding-right:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:0\">A concept to showcase Diorama’s work, for the moment capable of instructions on where and what size to position work, this will allow anyone without experience of code to curate the interior.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true},\"id\":774,\"width\":\"500px\",\"height\":\"500px\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/lab.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-774\" style=\"object-fit:cover;width:500px;height:500px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\"><strong>Aesthetic exploration</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"50%\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\",\"padding\":{\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Creating websites its not an easy and direct task. There is always a balance between the visual experience and usability. Meaning we have to avocate for the smoothness and the sense of the experience as well.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is why exploration of our limitations (like size of 3d models and lighting) guides our creativity to different areas.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This way, we can share this experiences to anyone, anytime, anywhere in the world.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"50%\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":775,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/image-868x1024.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-775\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"50%\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\",\"padding\":{\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":797,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/model-ezgif.com-optimize.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-797\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Importing 3d models</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"50%\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true},\"id\":796,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/materials-ezgif.com-optimize.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-796\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"> Materials and lighting</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true},\"id\":795,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/camera-ezgif.com-optimize-1.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-795\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Camera movements and navigation</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:block {\"ref\":840} /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','Diorama','','inherit','closed','closed','','770-revision-v1','','','2024-07-30 14:00:57','2024-07-30 12:00:57','',770,'http://localhost:10003/?p=862',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (863,1,'2024-07-30 14:01:10','2024-07-30 12:01:10','<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Heading\"},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}},\"className\":\"heading\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"600px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group heading\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":1,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}}} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">CIXI</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\"}},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|contrast\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"contrast\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-contrast-color has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-right:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-left:0\">A startup in the French alps developing mobility solutions that work for an adoption of physical activity and overall wellness through electric pedaling vehicles and their technology.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Content\"},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}},\"className\":\"content\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"wideSize\":\"600px\",\"contentSize\":\"600px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group content\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:0\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true},\"id\":643,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Screens-ui-2-1024x576.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-643\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\"><strong>Onboard screens and design research</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<p style=\"padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0\"><strong>Goal:</strong>&nbsp;Define and test user interactions on the Vigoz, a vehicle controlled by pedaling and tilting that arrives up to 120 km/h.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<p style=\"padding-right:0;padding-left:0\">The possible users, as we discovered, were people interested on getting healthy, but not necessarily fit or energetic. So, How to define an interactive system to support changing the \"Effort level\" and making physical activity while keeping a certain premium feeling and of course, focusing on the ride ?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"50%\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\",\"padding\":{\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To understand if this interactions could work, we tested “lego type” prototypes to switch between different interaction interfaces and screens on a first internal research with people within the company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We decided to have a second research, inviting possible customers over and designing a full interaction experience with the pedaling environment over virtual reality to understand what way to go, which type of screens, handles and functionalities to support.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For the planning of the research, with a team of three designers with different skillsets, we were able to take the best of us during this sprint. Carlos (head of design at CIXI , experience on IDEO, Lego) lead the research and interviews and designed an onboarding process, Daniel Sanchez (industrial designer) helped with the design of handles and several 3d printed elements and I took the role for the digital prototypes and “magic wizard”.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"50%\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true},\"id\":644,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/prototypes.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-644\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true},\"id\":645,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/unnamed-1-1.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-645\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":646,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/screens-top-1024x576.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-646\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}}} -->\n<p style=\"padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20)\">The test consisted on going through a theoretical acquisition of a membership with the Vigoz through a web prototype, understanding client expectations, using a web app and pedaling on the cardboard prototype. We had really interesting results, realizing there was still a long path to support our philosophy and promote a new vehicle which is neither a bicycle nor a car.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div style=\"text-align:center;display:flex;justify-content:center\"><iframe center=\"\" src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/723977908?h=e9b5b1c9c5&amp;autoplay=1&amp;loop=1&amp;autopause=0\" width=\"1280\" height=\"500\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}}} -->\n<p style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">Regarding the top touchscreen, unfortunately we had to let go the idea, it required too much cognitive effort.&nbsp;We went instead to a new solution…</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"columns\":2,\"linkTo\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-2 is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":698,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/IMG_0156-scaled-1-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-698\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">checking account</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":700,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/DSC00320-scaled-1-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-700\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">tracking tests</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":699,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/IMG_0421-scaled-1-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-699\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">app</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":701,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/IMG_0268-scaled-1-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-701\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">multiple interactions</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":702,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/IMG_0444-scaled-1-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-702\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">pedalling</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":697,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/IMG_0255-scaled-1-1024x575.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-697\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">immersive prototyping</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"50%\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\",\"padding\":{\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After a new exploration , we realized a \"panoramic screen\" in a combination with a more \"standard screen\" could be a great spot to enhance the possibilities and physical design of the interior. We decided to leave some functions on the mobile app ,so we could focus the best of the driving sensations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"50%\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:gallery {\"columns\":2,\"linkTo\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-2 is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":707,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/screen.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-707\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":705,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/screen_2.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-705\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":706,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/unnamed-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-706\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\"}}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\"><strong>Website and content creation</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We went through a process of finding the best communication strategy to show our motivation as CIXI and a little bit of our products without showing too much.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After some sketching and several graphic iterations, we focused on captivating interest through a combination of interactive animations by scrolling and \"easy-going\" animations by code (Lottie). </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">Note: 3D render by Carlos Torres</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"linkTo\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":722,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/logo_animation_repeated.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-722\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":723,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/meditation_timing-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-723\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":724,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/essential-comfort_color_padding-1024x683.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-724\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":709,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/bike.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-709\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":710,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/exam.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-710\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":711,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/animation_500_l56xwnzu.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-711\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":712,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/fast_hyfit_1080_square-1024x1024.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-712\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":713,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/hand.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-713\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":708,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/animation_500_l56x6299.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-708\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":714,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/gif_1-1.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-714\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A mobile approach allowed us to expose our philosophy for people or companies that were curious, where we deep-fully engaged with the subjects that move us.It was also important for us to grow our subscribers, with a simple design and enough about us, we encouraged people to follow our path.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n<p style=\"padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\">enjoyed being involved on the whole process of ideation, experimenting and co-creating how to communicate our vision. Flexibility, vision, getting into details and then at the big level where crucial points to arrive at this compromise of engaging, but simple introduction to what we are building.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":719,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Screens_website-1-1024x750.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-719\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Mobile version</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":718,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Screens_website_big-1024x640.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-718\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Desktop version</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\"}}}} -->\n<p style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">A small experiment of tackling an important subject : what we design and develop and its impact on the planet. It served a starting point to understand our communication tone, for sure there is much to do to have less impact on this planet.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://vimeo.com/991951744\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"vimeo\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-vimeo wp-block-embed-vimeo wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://vimeo.com/991951744\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:block {\"ref\":840} /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','CIXI design','','inherit','closed','closed','','618-revision-v1','','','2024-07-30 14:01:10','2024-07-30 12:01:10','',618,'http://localhost:10003/?p=863',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (864,1,'2024-07-30 14:01:28','2024-07-30 12:01:28','<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Heading\"},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}},\"className\":\"heading\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"600px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group heading\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":1,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}}} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">Liquid Motion</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\"}},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|contrast\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"contrast\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-contrast-color has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0\">Experimenting with code to create visually captivating liquid simulation, Based on the Generative Design book by Bohnacker, Groß, Laub and Lazzeroni.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Content\"},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}},\"className\":\"content\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"wideSize\":\"600px\",\"contentSize\":\"600px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group content\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:0\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div style=\"padding:50.25% 0 0 0;position:relative;\"><iframe src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/666986927?h=fc5864f7b7&amp;autoplay=1&amp;loop=1&amp;muted=1\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></div><script src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/api/player.js\"></script>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\"><strong>Creation process</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<p style=\"padding-right:0;padding-left:0\">In my first try, I did a basic test to overlap element, changing their opacity to test a \"fluid like\" behavior, but it was not enough ( ack of viscosity and too much processing power to create nodes).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There was a need to add a more complex backbone that could create and delete particles in a dynamic way.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The metaball concept changed the overall vision of my program, a mathematical expression that defined the structure of an element by its relationship with others and the canvas, continuously calculating its apperance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For the rest of the experimentation I just had fun creating a visual playground for myself, adding different characteristics and tools.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>See the complete process&nbsp;<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1I-84yYxFHiD-3ZfWvwWK4KAqWT_tnz2b?usp=sharing\">here</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:block {\"ref\":840} /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','Liquid motion','','inherit','closed','closed','','754-revision-v1','','','2024-07-30 14:01:28','2024-07-30 12:01:28','',754,'http://localhost:10003/?p=864',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (865,1,'2024-07-30 14:01:51','2024-07-30 12:01:51','<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Heading\"},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}},\"className\":\"heading\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"600px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group heading\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":1,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}}} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">What feels real</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\"}},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|contrast\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"contrast\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-contrast-color has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-right:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-left:0\">Thesis work \"Impact of experimental animation on modern audiovisual experiences\" for Digital &amp; Interaction Design masters program on Politecnico di Milano.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Content\"},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}},\"className\":\"content\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"wideSize\":\"600px\",\"contentSize\":\"600px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group content\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:0\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true},\"id\":757,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/brief.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-757\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\"><strong>Research background</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}}} -->\n<p style=\"padding-right:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-left:0\">The thesis proposes a new analysis point from a modern perspective, based on the two main areas of animation that formed the works we see today on motion design: orthodox and experimental (as defined by Paul Wells on his book “Defining animation”). It also questions the new possibility of merging factors from both into a new more dynamic perspective.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":758,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Experimental.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-758\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Experimental animation</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":759,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Orthodox.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-759\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Orthodox animation</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\"><strong>Experimentation</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"top\",\"width\":\"50%\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\",\"padding\":{\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top\" style=\"padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\">Two different types of animations regarding “Social distancing on times of coronavirus”&nbsp;were developed and tested with 20 people in order to measure emotional response.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"50%\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true},\"id\":761,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/double_diamon_process.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-761\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://vimeo.com/991969556\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"vimeo\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-vimeo wp-block-embed-vimeo wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://vimeo.com/991969556\n</div><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Test video based on Orthodox animation</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://vimeo.com/991970680\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"vimeo\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-vimeo wp-block-embed-vimeo wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://vimeo.com/991970680\n</div><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Test video based on Experimental animation</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\"><strong>Insights</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The value of experimenting with abstract capabilities was clearly evident, whilst having certain elements like humans or humanlike behavior was beneficial as well to promote the main communicational intentions. This opened up a discussion and further analysis to discover how on future audiovisual scenarios the value of experimenting and defining a motion language could clearly benefit the communicational intentions, specially speaking about interactive scenarios and future integration with new technology.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>See the full thesis&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.politesi.polimi.it/handle/10589/167499\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">here</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:block {\"ref\":840} /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','What feels real','','inherit','closed','closed','','756-revision-v1','','','2024-07-30 14:01:51','2024-07-30 12:01:51','',756,'http://localhost:10003/?p=865',0,'revision','',0);
